  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey! How's everything going?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, good. Thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.88,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "There's a silent film screening with a live pianist next week. Is that going to be boring?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Probably not. Live music changes everything. The pianist reacts to the film, so it feels like a performance, not an old movie.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I've never seen a silent film. Is it hard to follow?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.48,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not really. They tell the story with big expressions and title cards between scenes. Comedies especially are very easy to enjoy.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is this one a comedy?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.85,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "If it's a slapstick one, expect stunts that are genuinely jaw dropping. People did insane things without special effects.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.91,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, now I'm",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.98,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "actually kind of curious.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.28,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Go. Sit somewhere you can see the pianist too, watching them follow the action is half the fun.",
